# Factory HQ v2.0 — LLM keys for the creative agents.
#
# REUSE THE SAME KEYS that already power your Cyrus AI bot.
# The bot and the factory agents can share one Anthropic / OpenAI key:
# no new signup needed, usage draws from the same credit you already have.
#
# HOW TO USE (on your laptop):
#   1. Copy this file to ".env" in the factory folder (same folder as app.py)
#   2. Paste your existing bot API key(s) after the = sign
#   3. Run the factory normally:  ./venv/bin/python app.py
#
# The creative agents (idea_maker, ads_angles, faq_builder, nightly_reporter,
# content_writer, support_tone, seo_writer, testimonial_drafter) will then use
# the strong AI. Without keys they still work in rule-based mode.
#
# NEVER commit the real .env file to git. It stays on your laptop only.
# Only ONE key is needed — Anthropic is tried first, OpenAI is the fallback.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
